Subject: [PATCH 27/37] AOSCOS: Reconcile input build options with the 6.8
 build configuration

Upstream-Id: 80c424b5b980348f119e2de752a85bbd7f14a847

Keep the current 6.8 release requirements, dependency layout and
subdirectories while reconnecting the native input backend options. Do not
restore a second copy of the generated configuration or obsolete dependency
checks.

Assisted-by: gpt-6.1-sol
Signed-off-by: SignKirigami <prcups@krgm.moe>
---
 CMakeLists.txt | 39 +++++++++++++++++++--------------------
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 1ce04a47a..987d3790a 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -2,13 +2,13 @@ cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.16)
 
 project(plasma-desktop)
 
-set(PROJECT_VERSION "6.7.80")
+set(PROJECT_VERSION "6.8.3")
 string(REPLACE "." ";" VERSION_LIST ${PROJECT_VERSION})
 list(GET VERSION_LIST 0 PROJECT_VERSION_MAJOR)
 
